              <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Solidity Language is a tool we use to create machine-level codes that can be executed on the EVM.
                  It's a language that has a compiler that takes our high-level human-readable source code and breaks
                  it down to simple instructions such as "put data in a register", “add data from two registers”,
                  "jump back at instruction...
                </div>
              </div>
